    turnFlow: 'Players take role actions to move, shore up flooded tiles, give cards, and claim treasures using matching treasure cards. After each turn, the flood deck floods or sinks island tiles, while Waters Rise cards increase pressure and reshuffle threats. The group wins or loses together.',
